flowchart LR
client["Merchant / application<br/>Stable idempotency key"] -->|HTTPS| proxy["NGINX reverse proxy<br/>TLS / rate limits / load balancing"]
proxy --> api["Payment API replicas<br/>Auth / request hash / validation"]
api --> orchestrator["Payment orchestrator<br/>Intent / attempt / state machine"]
orchestrator -->|1. persist attempt| db[("PostgreSQL authority<br/>Intent / attempt / idempotency<br/>Balanced journal + outbox")]
orchestrator -->|2. stable provider identity| adapter["Bank / network adapter<br/>Timeout / circuit breaker / bulkhead"]
adapter --> bank["External bank / processor<br/>ISO 20022 / ISO 8583 adapter"]
bank -.->|signed callback| inbox["Webhook receiver + durable inbox<br/>Verify signature / dedupe event"]
inbox -.-> transition["State transition worker<br/>Match reference / amount / currency"]
transition -->|guarded version update| db
api -->|non-authoritative config| redis[("Redis<br/>Routing cache / rate budgets")]
api --> status["Status endpoint<br/>Pending / unknown / final"]
status -->|authoritative read| db
